// against the v2-plan launch's own four arenas (gunbc.spark.arm_memory_experiment_observed's
// envelope-derived bundle) — ONE launch's evidence, no cross-launch composition: the v1-image
// launch's plan and arenas stay at their own 1035-block inventory and are witnessed below only to
